/-- **The regime**: eventually, for all `1 ≤ p ≤ Pmax`, `2 ≤ s p` and `(s p)^1249 ≤ n^71`. -/
theorem regime : ∀ᶠ n : ℕ in atTop, ∀ p : ℕ, 1 ≤ p → p ≤ PmaxOf n →
